00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:31.780
The Final Act

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.780
Our only option is to fight.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:17.240
I've already sent the girls to defend
the four gates.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:18.910
But, the enemy has a thousand men.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.290
We are only seven.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.580
We will need your help, hime-sama.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:25.580
Yes.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:26.960
Please wait!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.000
Zushonosuke!

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.500
Please, wait a moment.

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:34.050
I will confront the troops and try to
persuade them to stop the assault.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:39.100
A mere human is not worthy
of making suggestions.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.310
If we let this war advance, both sides
will be severely wounded.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.390
We cannot be wounded.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:49.150
Tomihime!

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.530
This castle belongs to us,
the forgotten gods.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.070
We cannot forgive those
that trespass here.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.910
No matter what you say, I must fulfill
my duty to protect this sacred castle.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.260
Charge!

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:33.940
If the gate does not fall,
set the ladders up!

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.510
W-What are you doing here, woman?

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:02.680
I was dancing.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.310
Damn it! So you are an evil spirit!

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:27.870
Damn! The advance party
hasn't returned yet?

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.230
Y-You must be...

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.650
You think we can eat all of them?

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.360
They look filthy...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.440
Let's just throw them away.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:16.250
Don't! Make them stop at once!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.800
It is already too late.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.890
Weaker than I imagined.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.610
It's just a matter of time.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.110
The humans will lose.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.900
Well, don't be so sure.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.450
No matter how many you kill,
more will come back like bugs.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.950
That's how humans are.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.000
My goodness, will it ever end?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.180
Will you please...

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:11.850
...just die?

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.270
Stink! Stink! Stink! All of you!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.150
Release!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.360
What the...?

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:24.450
Aim!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.280
Using these things...

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.420
Nadeshiko!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.500
Get out of my way!

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.300
How could she be bleeding?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.060
Get in the castle quickly.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.890
Now is our chance!
The enemy has retreated!

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.560
Into the castle!

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.320
Damn demons...

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:25.470
My name is Odawara Shuri.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:26.800
I'm Kikyou.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.470
I request a one-on-one duel.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:32.930
Much appreciated.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.640
Stand back.

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.190
So the rumors were true.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.280
This place is filled
with beautiful women.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:48.820
Begin!

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:58.000
I appreciate your compliments.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.250
W-Wait, I am a samurai.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.710
Let me die in honor by my katana.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.360
Kuhei! Now!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.580
This is my first time killing a woman.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.210
It is also my first to kill
a nonhuman being.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:56.520
Kikyou has met her fate.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.480
As I thought, our powers
have become weak.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:05.070
Kuzu and Ominaeshi are somehow
holding the forces back.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.900
But at this rate, they will
soon be inside the keep tower.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.160
I'm going now.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.290
I don't want you up here.

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:26.840
You must also head down.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.180
Where are you taking me?

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.230
I should be joining Tomihime.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.900
How horrifying.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:46.360
A mere human making advances
on our hime-sama.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.980
Revolting!

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.490
Die!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.080
Zushonosuke?

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.440
O-Oshizu?!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:33.610
This way!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.410
Damn humans...

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:46.170
How dare she mark my body!

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:55.470
This way.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.770
Oshizu, why are you here?!

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.390
I wanted to see you!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.360
We're husband and wife.
What other reason do you need?

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:18.990
Zushonosuke.

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:20.910
You're unharmed?

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:40.600
Tomihime!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:45.850
Are you all right?!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.020
W-Why?!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.110
Don't you know that she's a demon?

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:53.820
I am sorry, Oshizu.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.070
I am no longer...

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.540
Die, demon!

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.170
Zushonosuke-san! How could you?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:24.970
Zushonosuke-san!

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:27.980
Zushonosuke-san, are you all right?

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.660
Am I no longer human?

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.540
The boundaries between
the human realm...

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.210
...and the god realm
are beginning to fall apart.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.760
Hime-sama!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.720
You still have time...

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.680
Leave this castle at once!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.690
No, this is how it's meant to be.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.360
It is not!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.910
You were willing to throw away
everything for me.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.620
Now it's my turn.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.750
But...

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.920
If you've relinquished your powers
to become closer to humans,

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.170
I consider myself a forgotten human
for giving up humanity.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:37.670
Zushonosuke...

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:46.140
Let us protect our castle.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:49.100
Fire!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.020
Fire!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.490
Don't touch them!

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:07.870
Do not touch them with
those filthy hands!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.260
Kuzu! Ominaeshi!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:28.970
Uba-sama...

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:33.640
How shall we prepare
for this evening's performance?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.320
Uba-sama!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:47.570
The fire!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:04.300
Hagi! Uba!

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:15.850
Uba!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:20.650
Even I couldn't eat such a large number.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.110
Hang on!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:26.610
Hime, you resemble
your mother so much.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:29.660
Especially how you
never listen to my words.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.160
I've heard that...

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.330
when humans pass away,
water flows from their eyes.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:40.880
It doesn't seem like such a bad thing.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.010
Uba!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.850
Get back, Tomihime!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.100
T-Tomihime.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:38.690
W-Wait!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.750
Fire!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.860
You're the falconer.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:25.860
Your face!

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.150
You've sold your soul to the demons?

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.710
W-Why didn't you dodge?

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:45.960
Forgive my betrayal!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:53.510
K-Kuhei, there's no way we can win.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:11.150
What are you doing?!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.530
Hurry up and go!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.910
There is no one left.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:19.120
Silence! I am commanding
you to assault the castle!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:24.580
You worthless scoundrel!
Is anyone around?

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.010
You're the falconer!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.390
You've finally brought back the falcon!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.930
You are late, but I commend your deed!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.180
We can finally present this
to our Shogun.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.920
Is this... what we wished for?

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.220
Mother?

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:13.110
Flowers.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.320
It's raining flowers.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.620
Oh well, it's no good.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.960
Hey, how does it look over there?

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.590
Only corpses.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.340
They didn't have to go this far.

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:40.640
Indeed, so which side won?

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.050
Who knows? It doesn't concern us.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.640
Let's go.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.350
Hey, look...

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.400
More birds...

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:55.610
That would mean...

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.120
Tenshu Monogatari

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:08.080
